{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさまこんばんは！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"北野日奈子です(｡・・｡)！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は朝早起きして\nハンバーグを朝からたくさん食べました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"夜ご飯にもハンバーグ1個半食べたよ！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ハンバーグ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はハンバーグばっかり！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ハンバーグすき！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/06/29/1197871/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/06/29/1197871/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"UTBさん発売中です！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/06/29/1197871/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さん、貞子vs伽倻子の映画\nみましたかー？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あれは、映画館でみたほうがいいですよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ネタバレしちゃうといけないから\nいろいろは話せませんが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最強に強いです！2人とも！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"貞子と伽倻子！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それから、霊媒師さんって本当にすごい方だって思いました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近、みたい映画がたくさんあります！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全部みれたらいいな～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"世界から猫が消えたなら は\n2回みました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とてもいいお話で\n何度観ても感動します！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"人とのつながりや\n何気ない物でも\nたくさんの思い出や感情が\nそこにあるんだなーって思いました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この一瞬一瞬を無駄にしないように\n私らしく楽しみながら頑張ります！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/06/29/1197871/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近ね、マンゴーを飲んだり食べたりできるようになってね、\nそれからはマンゴーってつくものを何でも試したくなってるの！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ドライフルーツもだいすきだけど、\nスムージーもすきになったの！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんはあんまり食べたりしなかったものや\n苦手なもので最近食べれるようになったものとかありますか？(｡・・｡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/06/29/1197871/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お母さんにお家で\nヒナセレやりなさいよっ！！！って\n怒られた10秒後に\nお父さんにメールで\nヒナセレやらなきゃ！！！って\n2人に同時に言われたので\n本当にそろそろやります。。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"待たせてしまってすみません。。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それよか、ぱぱとまま\n違う場所にいたし\nヒナセレの話し今日別にしてないのに\n同時くらいに言ってきたことが\nびっくり！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/06/29/1197871/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/06/29/1197871/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"チップ、暑すぎで\n顔が。、。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/06/29/1197871/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それでは今日はこのへんで！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おやすみなさい！"}],"source":"archive"}